  CardStory: "Clubs2 isn\u2019t sure what is going on, but he knows something isn\u2019t
    right. On his way to report he avoids mirrors, he refuses to talk, to even think
    too much about anything.\r\n\r\nHe must get to the Sergeant, to the Commander!
    Powerful soldiers, those whose bones and brains have been acclimated to power
    the most. They\u2019ll be able to resist, to mount a counter offensive! Little
    by little clarity returns, and Clubs2 remembers."
